{title: Bapu Zamidar}
{artist: Jassi Gill}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m]Main ta chetak lya si,Palle adh ke,        [B]Bebe ji de muhre,Haade kadh ke,
[A]Suneya ae lencer ohne le layi,        [G#]Ikk time wali roti jehi, [C#m]Chadh ke
[C#m]Rabba edda waddha faasla,        [C#m]Kiyu saade vichkaar,
[C#m]Oh daddy ji de cash utte,        [B]Kari jawe aish
Sada [A]baapu zimidaar,        Kitho [C#m]le ke deve car...!
[C#m]Oh daddy ji de cash utte,        [B]Kari jawe aish
Sada [A]baapu zimidaar,        Kitho [C#m]le ke deve car...!
[C#m]Oh taan college di,Fees ohni bhardi,        Saade [B]aarhat te jinne,Paise pye ne,
[A]Khaaban wale mehal usardi,        Saade [G#]sadhraan de ghar,Tahio [C#m]dhahe ne
[C#m]Hun dasso kiwen juru,Saade dil wali taar,        [C#m]Oh daddy ji de cash utte,
[B]Kari jawe aish,        Sada [A]baapu zimidaar,
Kitho [C#m]le ke deve car...!        [C#m]Oh taan wadheyan ch,Pali matt hor ae,
Taahi [B]kar dena aapan ignore ae,        [A]Bhola bhaala mukh ohda jaapda,
[G#]Par lagge mainu,Dil vich [C#m]chor ae,        [C#m]Chhad happy raikoti,karna nahi izahar
[C#m]Oh daddy ji de cash utte,        [B]Kari jawe aish
Sada [A]baapu zimidaar,        Kitho [C#m]le ke deve car...!
